    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are thrilled to present this substantial 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom duplex to the market, perfectly situated on the vibrant Adamstown Avenue, Adamstown. This exceptionally sought-after development boasts close proximity to Lucan Village, placing an abundance of local conveniences right on your doorstep. Just a brief stroll away, you will discover popular neighborhood bars, retail shops, and reputable schools. \r\n\r\nCommuting is effortless with a variety of efficient bus routes, immediate access to the N4 and M50 motorways, and Adamstown Train Station providing seamless links directly into the heart of Dublin city centre. \r\nBright and spacious living accommodation of c. 112 Sqm spread out over two floors comprises of entrance hallway, under stairs storage, wc, living room and kitchen/diner to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find three bedrooms, master ensuite and the family bathroom. Externally you have a fully enclosed court yard style garden with rear access to the communal parking area. \r\n\r\nN0 34 comes to the market in great condition throughout and has a list of added benefits including double glazed windows, gas central heating and no forward chain. Based on size and location we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today. \r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nBER B\r\nc. 112 Sqm\r\nMGT Fees 1550 Per annum\r\nFantastic location\r\nNo forward chain\r\nAdamstown Train Station close by\r\nOwn door Duplex\r\nThree bed/Three baths\r\nGas central heating\r\nSchools in close walking distance\r\nCommunal parking\r\nSought after development \r\nClose to shops, schools and major road networks\r\nViewing is highly advised!\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nK78 KK55"
      },
      {
